<title>MOROCCO: ACCOR signs Moroccan pact on $100 mln fund.</title>
<headline>ACCOR signs Moroccan pact on $100 mln fund.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>French hotel group Accor on Thursday signed an agreement with Morocco to set up a $100 million international fund aimed at upgrading current tourism projects, a finance ministry spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>&quot;Accor group senior managers were received by His Majesty King Hassan on Thursday, after they signed with Moroccan officials a convention aimed at establishing a $100 million international investment fund,&quot; the spokeswoman told Reuters.</p>
<p>The convention covers investments in Moroccan existing tourist assts and the creation new projects, she added.</p>
</text>
